Data attribution:

Alberta beef export values (data/beef-exports.csv) and destination
coordinates (data/coordinates.csv): Statistics Canada; and Alberta
Agriculture and Forestry, Statistics and Data Development Section.

Country boundary geometry (data/countries-110m.json): Natural Earth
(public domain), via the D3 TopoJSON collection.

Alberta province boundary geometry (added to data/countries-110m.json):
click_that_hood (Code for Germany), public/data/canada.geojson —
https://github.com/codeforgermany/click_that_hood , derived from the
"ArcGIS Canada Boundary" dataset (ArcGIS item dcbcdf86939548af81efbd2d732336db).
